Package: adzan
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: dimas <dimas@unitesync.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/dimasyotama/adzan-cli
Suggests: mpv | ffmpeg | mpg123
Description: Prayer times and the adhan, in your terminal
 adzan computes prayer times locally and plays the adhan at the right
 moment, with a small background daemon, a CLI, and an optional menu
 bar tray icon. Run `adzan setup` after installing to choose a location.
